    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d17a6b5ba1057a7b0f7e04bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……我现在还这么不起眼，\n要跟她们一起演戏根本是在做梦吧，啊哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02b2cc65faf40f3a28a09f5f7b902680554301a818df2370c1f2736d1e8dd9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
