    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd13c8ce647cc3a73ffd3183",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "雪之美人一副惶恐的模样，\n但我脑海里浮现了她刚才的低语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "812c62d762a530ba874952346939f960b8f7782c8211f129e34735fcbe5ec53d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
