      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f49e64b0b52f0a64ed48caad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“总有一天……我一定也要……”\n她的这个愿望真的遥不可及吗？\n有没有办法让她稍微接近一些呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb197e63a526fd14a467239d3457d6074be2cd96fbae6d677e6d7200a1bd3af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1029/storytimeline_501029702.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df19499df37c5d60ced2d03f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比方说，如果是戏份跟台词都不多的角色，\n要让她饰演应该不是那么困难──",
      "source_fingerprint": "86ca52dff06519553b3dce4e8b689ea96024288f7710b59126378e7206f839af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
